    "dashboardGrowth::default": "One behavior, held for a week. Not five, explained beautifully, dropped by Thursday.",
    "dashboardCampaign::default": "They answered without you in the room. That is the rarest data you have about yourself.",
    "dashboardResults::default": "Two things are true: your clarity is worth something, and your bench is not growing. Hold both without resolving them.",
    "selfAssessment::default": "You go first. And you do not get to see theirs and adjust — that is the point of the sequence.",
