    "dashboardEvidence::t1-s5": "97, and you put yourself at 67. People know what winning looks like in their own job. You gave yourself less credit than they did.",
    "dashboardEvidence::trait-2": "Effort 90, effect 74. Here they can see you working — which they couldn't in the last room. The pushing is visible.",
    "dashboardSignal::sent-t2-q01": "From their seat, this one feels like a lot of care arriving slightly short of the mark.",
    "dashboardSignal::sent-t2-q02": "Spotting what's coming, adjusting when the facts move — that's where they put you highest. Nobody has to wonder if you're paying attention.",
    "dashboardSignal::sent-t2-q03": "Saying it more often made the effort obvious. It didn't make the destination clearer.",
    "dashboardEvidence::t2-s1": "Effort 100, effect 40 — and you called it yourself at 60. You've said it often enough that it feels understood.",
    "dashboardEvidence::t2-s2": "83, right where you had it. The why does arrive. This is the thing people mean when they say your rooms are worth being in.",
    "dashboardEvidence::t2-s3": "95, and you guessed 95. You change your mind out loud when the facts change — rarer than you think, and they see it.",
    "dashboardEvidence::t2-s4": "You said 83, they said 74, with effort at 98. The line from their desk to the org isn't as drawn as all that effort suggests.",
    "dashboardEvidence::t2-s5": "93. You get ahead of what's coming and they feel prepared for it. This is you at your steadiest.",
    "dashboardEvidence::trait-3": "Effort 90, effect 28 — the widest split you've got. Maximum visible sweat, least felt result. And you half-knew it at 40.",
    "dashboardSignal::sent-t3-q01": "Under a deadline they watch you absorb it. From where they sit it reads as effort with nowhere to land.",
    "dashboardSignal::sent-t3-q02": "What you're getting right here is that nobody doubts you're carrying it. At 28, that's most of what's left.",
    "dashboardSignal::sent-t3-q03": "They see the schedule pressure stopping at you and never getting renegotiated with anyone. You call that protecting them.",
    "dashboardEvidence::t3-s1": "17, and you rated it about right at 33. The dates get agreed to before anyone checks whether they're real.",
    "dashboardEvidence::t3-s2": "Effort 100 on context, 31 on early. They get the whole story — after you've already worked out how to absorb it.",
    "dashboardEvidence::t3-s3": "Full effort, 19 effect. Most of that energy is going into doing the blocked work yourself instead of clearing the block.",
    "dashboardEvidence::t3-s4": "Team delivery reads 34 while your effort reads 83. That's the arithmetic of everything routing through one person.",
    "dashboardEvidence::t3-s5": "56 — the best number in this room, and it's trust. They're certain you'll do it yourself. That's the thing you built."
