    "dashboardEvidence::snapshot": "The receipts keep. Come back whenever your certainty starts filling in a story the evidence didn't tell.",
    "dashboardEvidence::ev-intro": "You go slowly here. This is the one room where you are not the one who knows.",
    "dashboardEvidence::ev-gaps": "A gap is not an accusation against you. It is the precise spot where a conversation would teach you more than another explanation would.",
    "dashboardEvidence::ev-floor": "Three statements, ranked by need. If you change one thing this cycle, the top of this list is where the people who count on you feel it.",
    "dashboardEvidence::ev-trait": "One exhibit at a time. Read what they said before you build the reasonable account of why they said it.",
